---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="About Inscio | NetSuite Consulting Firm"
  description="NetSuite Expertise, Without the Noise. Inscio was founded because we saw the same patterns over and over — honest about scope, disciplined about execution."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-[#0D1235] text-white py-28 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <p class="text-blue-400 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-6">COMPANY</p>
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold leading-tight mb-8 max-w-3xl">NetSuite Expertise, Without the Noise.</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">Our only agenda is yours: simplify, scale, and grow.</p>
      <a href="https://calendly.com/brian-gallagher-inscio/netsuite-strategy-session" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-block mt-10 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded transition-colors">
        Schedule a Strategy Call
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mission -->
  <section class="bg-white py-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">We are on a mission to empower companies</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
        We believe NetSuite should work for your business — not the other way around. Our mission is to make ERP implementations less painful, faster to value, and easier to live with. From day-one rollouts to decade-long partnerships, we help companies run smarter on the platform they've already chosen.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Story -->
  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">The story behind how our company was founded</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-10">
        Inscio was founded because we saw the same patterns over and over — overscoped implementations, stalled rollouts, customers left holding a configuration they couldn't actually run. We built Inscio to be the partner we wished we'd had: honest about scope, disciplined about execution, and in it for the long haul after go-live.
      </p>
      <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-blue-600 pl-8 py-2">
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 italic leading-relaxed">
          "Our job is to make NetSuite feel like it was built for your business — and then get out of the way so your team can run on it."
        </p>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Values -->
  <section class="bg-white py-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mb-14">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Our values</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg">Twenty years in, these aren't aspirational. They're how we actually operate.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-7 hover:border-blue-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Integrity</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Doing the right thing sometimes costs us. We're okay with that. It's the only way to build the kind of client relationships worth having.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-7 hover:border-blue-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Partnership</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">We don't just work for our clients. We work with them. That means aligning on goals early, staying in it through the hard parts, and making sure success means the same thing to both sides.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-7 hover:border-blue-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Accountability</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">We own our work from kickoff to go-live. When something doesn't go as planned, we don't look for someone to blame. We fix it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-7 hover:border-blue-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Long-Term Value</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">We're not optimizing for the current statement of work. We're thinking about where your business will be in five years and building something that gets you there. The best clients we have came back after their first project because we earned it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-7 hover:border-blue-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Generosity</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">For every hour our consultants bill, one dollar goes to a charity of their choosing. Each person picks what matters to them. It adds up, and it keeps giving back personal rather than just a policy.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Life at Inscio -->
  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mb-12">
        <p class="text-blue-600 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Our culture</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Life at Inscio</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed">Twenty years in, we still show up like it's the best job we've ever had. Here's proof.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Tab buttons -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-8" id="culture-tabs">
        <button class="culture-tab active-tab px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium border transition-all flex items-center gap-2" data-panel="work">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M20.25 14.15v4.25c0 1.094-.787 2.036-1.872 2.18-2.087.277-4.216.42-6.378.42s-4.291-.143-6.378-.42c-1.085-.144-1.872-1.086-1.872-2.18v-4.25m16.5 0a2.18 2.18 0 0 0 .75-1.661V8.706c0-1.081-.768-2.015-1.837-2.175a48.114 48.114 0 0 0-3.413-.387m4.5 8.006c-.194.165-.42.295-.673.38A23.978 23.978 0 0 1 12 15.75c-2.648 0-5.195-.429-7.577-1.22a2.016 2.016 0 0 1-.673-.38m0 0A2.18 2.18 0 0 1 3 12.489V8.706c0-1.081.768-2.015 1.837-2.175a48.111 48.111 0 0 1 3.413-.387m7.5 0V5.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 13.5 3h-3a2.25 2.25 0 0 0-2.25 2.25v.894m7.5 0a48.667 48.667 0 0 0-7.5 0M12 12.75h.008v.008H12v-.008Z" /></svg>
          Work
        </button>
        <button class="culture-tab px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium border transition-all flex items-center gap-2" data-panel="play">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.182 15.182a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-6.364 0M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-18 0 9 9 0 0 1 18 0ZM9.75 9.75c0 .414-.168.75-.375.75S9 10.164 9 9.75 9.168 9 9.375 9s.375.336.375.75Zm-.375 0h.008v.015h-.008V9.75Zm5.625 0c0 .414-.168.75-.375.75s-.375-.336-.375-.75.168-.75.375-.75.375.336.375.75Zm-.375 0h.008v.015h-.008V9.75Z" /></svg>
          Play
        </button>
        <button class="culture-tab px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium border transition-all flex items-center gap-2" data-panel="celebrate">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16.5 18.75h-9m9 0a3 3 0 0 1 3 3h-15a3 3 0 0 1 3-3m9 0v-3.375c0-.621-.503-1.125-1.125-1.125h-.871M7.5 18.75v-3.375c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h.872m5.007 0H9.497m5.007 0a7.454 7.454 0 0 1-.982-3.172M9.497 14.25a7.454 7.454 0 0 0 .981-3.172M5.25 4.236c-.982.143-1.954.317-2.916.52A6.003 6.003 0 0 0 7.73 9.728M5.25 4.236V4.5c0 2.108.966 3.99 2.48 5.228M5.25 4.236V2.721C7.456 2.41 9.71 2.25 12 2.25c2.291 0 4.545.16 6.75.47v1.516M7.73 9.728a6.726 6.726 0 0 0 2.748 1.35m8.272-6.842V4.5c0 2.108-.966 3.99-2.48 5.228m2.48-5.492a46.32 46.32 0 0 1 2.916.52 6.003 6.003 0 0 1-5.395 4.972m0 0a6.726 6.726 0 0 1-2.749 1.35m0 0a6.772 6.772 0 0 1-3.044 0" /></svg>
          Celebrate
        </button>
        <button class="culture-tab px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium border transition-all flex items-center gap-2" data-panel="giveback">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 8.25c0-2.485-2.099-4.5-4.688-4.5-1.935 0-3.597 1.126-4.312 2.733-.715-1.607-2.377-2.733-4.313-2.733C5.1 3.75 3 5.765 3 8.25c0 7.22 9 12 9 12s9-4.78 9-12Z" /></svg>
          Give Back
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Work panel -->
      <div id="panel-work" class="culture-panel">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3" style="grid-template-rows: 240px 200px 180px;">
          <div class="col-span-2 rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#0D1235] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/work-team-1.jpg" alt="Inscio team at work" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">The work we love</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#152060] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/work-team-2.jpg" alt="Inscio consultant working" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">Deep in the details</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#1a2060] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/work-team-3.jpg" alt="Team collaboration" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">One team</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#0d1a50] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/work-team-4.jpg" alt="Inscio team meeting" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">Aligned on what matters</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#0a1840] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/work-team-5.jpg" alt="Inscio consultant at client site" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">On-site, in it together</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#0f1e4a] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/work-team-6.jpg" alt="Team problem solving" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">Problem solvers</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-span-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#0D1235] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/work-team-7.jpg" alt="Inscio team" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center" />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">Built to last</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Play panel -->
      <div id="panel-play" class="culture-panel hidden">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3" style="grid-template-rows: 280px 220px 200px;">
          <div class="col-span-2 rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#1a0a40] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/play-1.jpg" alt="Team bumper cars" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">No mercy on the track</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#2d1060] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/play-2.jpg" alt="Team having fun" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">Good people</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#0a2060] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/play-3.jpg" alt="Team outing" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">Off the clock</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#1a0a40] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/play-4.jpg" alt="Team event" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">Team time</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#2d1060] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/play-5.jpg" alt="Team fun" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">Never a dull moment</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#0D1235] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/holiday-party.jpg" alt="Annual holiday party" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">Annual holiday party</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-span-2 rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#0a1840] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/play-6.jpg" alt="Team outing" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">The crew</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#1a0a40] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/live-music-night.jpg" alt="Team at live music night" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">Team night out</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Celebrate panel -->
      <div id="panel-celebrate" class="culture-panel hidden">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3" style="grid-template-rows: 300px 220px;">
          <div class="col-span-2 rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#0D1235] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/celebrate-2.jpg" alt="Inscio 20th anniversary party" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 to-transparent p-5">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">Inscio | 20 years</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#1a1040] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/celebrate-1.jpg" alt="Team dinner celebration" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">Good company</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#0D1235] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/anniversary-celebration.jpg" alt="20th anniversary celebration" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">20 years strong</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#152060] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/celebrate-3.jpg" alt="Happy Bosses Day cake" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">We celebrate everything</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#0a1840] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/anniversary-team.jpg" alt="Inscio team at 20th anniversary" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">The whole crew</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Give Back panel -->
      <div id="panel-giveback" class="culture-panel hidden">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3" style="grid-template-rows: 280px 220px;">
          <div class="col-span-2 rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#0a3020] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/giveback-volunteer-1.jpg" alt="Inscio team volunteering" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">Hands on</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#1a3010] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/giveback-volunteer-2.jpg" alt="Volunteering in the community" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">Showing up</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#0a2810] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/giveback-volunteer-3.jpg" alt="Team at community event" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">In the community</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#102810] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/volunteer-group.jpg" alt="Whole team at community event" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">The whole team pitches in</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#0a3020] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/volunteer-kids.jpg" alt="Team with kids at facility" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">Giving back, playing hard</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#1a3010] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/volunteer-sports.jpg" alt="Volunteering at youth sports" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">Youth sports day</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Give Back stats -->
      <div id="giveback-stats" class="hidden mt-6 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">103,000 lbs</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">food donated annually</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">85,000+</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">meals provided</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">7,500+</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">families helped each year</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">200</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">people with clean water in Ethiopia</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stat strip -->
      <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">20 Years</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500">together as a team</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Inc 500</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500">recognized growth company</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">People First</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500">always, in everything we do</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-[#0D1235] text-white py-20 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Ready to work with us?</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg mb-10">Book a free strategy call and tell us where you are with NetSuite. No pressure, no sales pitch — just honest conversation.</p>
      <a href="https://calendly.com/brian-gallagher-inscio/netsuite-strategy-session" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-block bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold px-10 py-4 rounded transition-colors">
        Schedule a Strategy Call
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<script>
  const tabs = document.querySelectorAll('.culture-tab');
  const panels = document.querySelectorAll('.culture-panel');

  tabs.forEach(tab => {
    tab.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const target = tab.dataset.panel;

      tabs.forEach(t => {
        t.classList.remove('active-tab', 'bg-white', 'text-gray-900', 'border-gray-300', 'shadow-sm');
        t.classList.add('text-gray-500', 'border-gray-200', 'hover:border-gray-300', 'hover:text-gray-700');
      });
      tab.classList.add('active-tab', 'bg-white', 'text-gray-900', 'border-gray-300', 'shadow-sm');
      tab.classList.remove('text-gray-500', 'border-gray-200');

      panels.forEach(p => p.classList.add('hidden'));
      document.getElementById('panel-' + target)?.classList.remove('hidden');
      const gbs = document.getElementById('giveback-stats');
      if (gbs) { if (target === 'giveback') { gbs.classList.remove('hidden'); } else { gbs.classList.add('hidden'); } }
    });
  });

  // Set initial tab styles
  tabs.forEach((tab, i) => {
    if (i === 0) {
      tab.classList.add('bg-white', 'text-gray-900', 'border-gray-300', 'shadow-sm');
    } else {
      tab.classList.add('text-gray-500', 'border-gray-200', 'hover:border-gray-300', 'hover:text-gray-700');
    }
  });
</script>
